  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support manufacturing of e-cargo bikes in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, Greenfoot Africa in partnership with Twende Social Innovation Centre is developing a purpose-built electric cargo bike aimed at improving the affordability and sustainability of transporting goods in Tanzania&apos;s urban and rural centers.  The project goal is to set up an initial production facility, develop operating tools, and launch a pilot in Arusha, Tanzania with a fleet of ten (10) electric cargo bikes.</narrative>
  </description>
